# Trained tables and recorded trajectories: binary, up to ~100 MB each, and rebuilt
# deterministically from their definitions. The chunk files next to them (cache/<key>/) are the
# certification evidence that `sim:certify --check` reads, and stay tracked.
cache/artifacts/

